{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"费力护住自尊后，他短暂尝到轻松，心思落在这份自在上。\",\n          \"key\": \"片刻自在\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他曾在费力克制中短暂感到轻松，注意力一度离开那份向往。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前段已经把克制写成耗力之事，因此短暂松弛有直接的心理来源，也符合把此处听成真切欢愉的一种解释。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选6\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"费力自持让他心里生出不甘，连守住自尊也像要付出过重代价。\",\n          \"key\": \"自持生怨\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"正在面对\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"维持自尊的努力也会引出不甘，成为他面对向往时的一层压力。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前段的费力自持足以解释不甘；但把难安进一步理解为对自我约束的怨意，是更鲜明也更冒进的读法。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bfa7616e-3b14-48b1-ae25-01b4fd864ef3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T034820863687Z", "elapsed_seconds": 129.453, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:50:30.330970+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a557e22719f63f1366cc86946f04036ae5bb64a6f88077178f7e59da2502575", "attachment_count": 0}, "str